<translation id="6072279588547424923">I-<ph name="EXTENSION_NAME" /> ingezwe ku-Monyhar</translation>
<translation id="608006075545470555">Engeza Iphrofayela Yomsebenzi kulesi siphequluli</translation>
<translation id="608189560609172163">I-Monyhar ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho ngenxa yephutha lokungena ngemvume.</translation>
<translation id="6096348254544841612">Enza ngendlela oyifisayo uphinde ulawule i-Monyhar. Isibuyekezo siyatholakala.</translation>
<translation id="6120345080069858279">I-Monyhar izolondoloza le phasiwedi ku-akhawunti yakho ye-Google. Ngeke kudingeke ukuthi uyikhumbule.</translation>
