<translation id="6212496753309875659">Le khompyutha isivele inenguqulo yakamuva kakhulu ye-Monyhar. Uma isofthiwe ingasebenzi, sicela ukhiphe i-Monyhar uphinde uzame futhi.</translation>
<translation id="6219195342503754812">{0,plural, =0{I-Monyhar izoqalisa kabusha manje}=1{I-Monyhar izoqalisa kabusha kusekhondi elingu-1}one{I-Monyhar izoqalisa kabusha kumasekhondi angu-#}other{I-Monyhar izoqalisa kabusha kumasekhondi angu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="6248213926982192922">Yenza i-Monyhar ibe yisiphequluli esizenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="6266342355635466082">I-Monyhar ayikwazi ukuhlola izibuyekezo. Zama ukuhlola ukuxhumeka kwakho ku-inthanethi.</translation>
<translation id="6268381023930128611">Phuma ku-Monyhar?</translation>
<translation id="6281746429495226318">Yenza ngokwezifiso iphrofayela yakho ye-Monyhar</translation>
<translation id="6290827346642914212">Qama iphrofayela lakho le-Monyhar</translation>
<translation id="6295779123002464101">I-<ph name="FILE_NAME" /> kungenzeka ibe ingozi, ngakho-ke i-Monyhar iyivimbile.</translation>
<translation id="6309712487085796862">I-Monyhar isebenzisa ikhamela yakho.</translation>
<translation id="6333502561965082103">Okunye ukusebenza ku-Monyhar kuyaqhubeka. Sicela uzame futhi emuva kwesikhathi.</translation>
<translation id="6334986366598267305">Manje kulula ukusebenzisa i-Monyhar nge-Akhawunti yakho ye-Google nakumakhompyutha abiwe.</translation>
<translation id="6373523479360886564">Ingabe uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna ukukhipha i-Monyhar?</translation>
<translation id="6403826409255603130">I-Monyhar yisiphequluli sewebhu esiqalisa amakhasi wewebhu nezinhlelo zokusebenza ngesivinini sombani. Iyashesha, izinzile, futhi isebenziseka kalula. Dlulisa amehlo kuwebhu ngokuvikeleke kakhulu ngokuvikelwa kuhlelo olungayilungele ikhompyutha nobugebengu bokweba imininingwane ebucayi eyakhelwe ku-Monyhar.</translation>
<translation id="6434250628340475518">Isistimu ye-Monyhar OS</translation>
