<translation id="673636774878526923">Ukuze ufinyelele ezintweni zakho ze-Monyhar kuwo wonke amadivayisi wakho, ngena ngemvume, bese uvula ukuvumelanisa.</translation>
<translation id="6774082503108938489">Umzali wakho uvale "Izimvume zamasayithi, izinhlelo zokusebenza, nezandiso" ze-Monyhar. Ukunika le <ph name="EXTENSION_TYPE_PARAMETER" /> akuvumelekile.</translation>
<translation id="6827182711503025204">Ukufaka i-Monyhar OS kuzokhipha yonke idatha kudivayisi yakho.</translation>
