<translation id="7627575518938382525"><ph name="BEGIN_PARAGRAPH1" />Ngaphambi kokuthi siqalise, sicela uqinisekise ukuthi unekhophi yasenqolobaneni esesikhathini yedatha yakho. Ukufaka i-Monyhar OS kuzokhipha yonke idatha ekokuphakelayo kwakho.<ph name="END_PARAGRAPH1" />
          <ph name="BEGIN_PARAGRAPH2" />I-Google ayinaso isibopho sanoma yikuphi ukulahlekelwa kwedatha, futhi ayiqinisekisi ukuthi i-Monyhar OS izosebenza kumamodeli angaqinisekisiwe. Sicela uvakashele i-[TBD] ukufunda kabanzi ngamamodeli aqinisekisiwe.<ph name="END_PARAGRAPH2" />
