          <ph name="BEGIN_PARAGRAPH4" />Uma usukulungele ukuqhubeka, chofoza okuthi “Faka i-Monyhar OS” futhi sizokuqondisa phakathi nokufaka ngezinyathelo ezimbalwa ezilula nje. Uzoba nelinye ithuba lokuqinisekisa ngaphambi kokuthi senze noma yiziphi izinguquko kukhompyutha yakho.<ph name="END_PARAGRAPH4" /></translation>
<translation id="7686590090926151193">I-Monyhar akusona isiphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="7689606757190482937">Vumelanisa uphinde wenze kube ngeyakho i-Monyhar kumadivayisi akho wonkana</translation>
<translation id="7729447699958282447">I-Monyhar ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho ngoba Ukuvumelanisa akutholakaleli isizinda sakho.</translation>
<translation id="7745317241717453663">Lokhu kuzosusa idatha yakho yokuphequlula kusukela kule divayisi. Ukuze uthole idatha yakho emuva kwesikhathi, ngena ngemvume ku-Monyhar njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL" />.</translation>
<translation id="7747138024166251722">Isifaki asikwazanga ukudala umkhombandlela wesikhashana. Sicela uhlolele isikhala esikhululekile sediski nemvume ukuze ufake isofthiwe.</translation>
<translation id="7790626492778995050"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /> - Monyhar Canary</translation>
<translation id="7828947555739565424">Iphrofayela ye-Monyhar enale akhawunti isikhona akakade kule divayisi</translation>
<translation id="7857220146454061152">Ukuze uthole izibuyekezo zesikhathi esizayo ze-Monyhar, uzodinga i-OS X 10.11 noma yakamuva. Le khompuyutha isebenzisa i-OS X 10.10.</translation>
<translation id="7867198900892795913">I-Monyhar ayikwazanga ukubuyekezela kwinguqulo yakamuva, ngakho-ke uyalahlekelwa kuzici ezintsha nokulungiswa kokuphepha.</translation>
<translation id="7898472181347242998">Ukuze ubone uma ngabe idivayisi yakho isesikhathini, hamba <ph name="LINK_BEGIN" />kuzilungiselelo ze-Monyhar OS<ph name="LINK_END" /></translation>
<translation id="7907774600618164274">I-Monyhar OS ayizange ivaleke kahle.</translation>
<translation id="7937630085815544518">Ubukade ungene ngemvume ku-Monyhar njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" />. Sicela usebenzise i-akhawunti efanayo ukuze uphinde ungene ngemvume futhi.</translation>
<translation id="7975919845073681630">Lokhu ukufakwa kwesibili kwe-Monyhar, futhi akukwazi ukwenziwa isiphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo.</translation>
<translation id="8013436988911883588">Uma i-Monyhar inokufinyelela, amawebhusayithi azokwazi ukukucela ukufinyelela.</translation>
<translation id="81770708095080097">Leli fayela liyingozi, ngakho-ke i-Monyhar iyivimbile.</translation>
<translation id="8248265253516264921">Uma isithombe singanayo incazelo ephelele, i-Monyhar izozama ukukunikezela eyodwa. Ukuze udale izincazelo, izithombe zithunyelwa ku-Google. Ungavala lokhu kuzilungiselelo noma kunini.</translation>
<translation id="8266560134891435528">I-Monyhar ayikwazi ukuhlola amaphasiwedi akho ngoba awungenanga ngemvume</translation>
<translation id="8276522524898344151">I-Monyhar izama ukukopisha amaphasiwedi.</translation>
<translation id="8290862415967981663">Leli fayela lingaba yingozi, ngakho-ke i-Monyhar iyivimbile.</translation>
<translation id="8330519371938183845">Ngena ngemvume ukuze uvumelanise uphinde wenze kube ngeyakho i-Monyhar kumadivayisi akho wonkana</translation>
