<translation id="8417404458978023919">{0,plural, =1{Qalisa kabusha i-Monyhar phakathi kosuku}one{Qalisa kabusha i-Monyhar phakathi kwezinsuku ezingu-#}other{Qalisa kabusha i-Monyhar phakathi kwezinsuku ezingu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="8453117565092476964">Ingobo yomlando yesifaki yonakele noma ayivumelekile. Sicela ulande futhi i-Monyhar.</translation>
