<translation id="8558383651099478961">Umzali wakho uvale "Izimvume zamasayithi, izinhlelo zokusebenza, nezandiso" ze-Monyhar. Ukwengeza le <ph name="EXTENSION_TYPE_PARAMETER" /> akuvumelekile.</translation>
