<translation id="8704119203788522458">Lena yi-Monyhar yakho</translation>
<translation id="8796602469536043152">I-Monyhar idinga imvume ukuze ifinyelele kukhamera yakho nemakrofoni yaleli sayithi</translation>
<translation id="8803635938069941624">Imigomo ye-Monyhar OS</translation>
<translation id="8821041990367117597">I-Monyhar ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho ngoba imininingwane yokungena ngemvume kwe-akhawunti yakho angaphandle kwedethi.</translation>
<translation id="8862326446509486874">Awunawo amalungelo afanele wokufakwa okukuleveli yesistimu. Zama ukuqalisa isifaki futhi njengomlawuli.</translation>
<translation id="8880203542552872219">Uma kunjalo, sicela uhlele iphasiwedi yakho elondoloziwe ku-Monyhar ukuze ifane nephasiwedi yakho entsha.</translation>
<translation id="8897323336392112261">Iphinda ilayishe ukuthi yiliphi ikhasi eliboniswayo uma uqala i-Monyhar noma uchofoza kunkinobho ye-Ikhaya.</translation>
<translation id="8907580949721785412">I-Monyhar izama ukubonisa amaphasiwedi. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="8941642502866065432">Ayikwazi ukubuyekeza i-Monyhar</translation>
<translation id="8974095189086268230">I-Monyhar OS yenziwa yenzeke yi-<ph name="BEGIN_LINK_CROS_OSS" />isofthiwe yomthombo ovulekile<ph name="END_LINK_CROS_OSS" /> engeziwe.</translation>
<translation id="8986207147630327271">Ungeza iphrofayela yomsebenzi kulesi siphequluli futhi unikeza umlawuli wakho ulawulo olungaphezulu nje kwephrofayela yomsebenzi.</translation>
<translation id="9019929317751753759">Ukuze senze i-Monyhar iphephe, sikhubaza isandiso esilandelayo esingafakiwe kuhlu lwe-<ph name="IDS_EXTENSION_WEB_STORE_TITLE" /> futhi kungenzeka singezwe ngaphandle kolwazi lakho.</translation>
